  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 17797189632
    m_Localized: PERFECT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521280
    m_Localized: HIGH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521281
    m_Localized: MEDIUM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521282
    m_Localized: LOW
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521283
    m_Localized: ZERO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763233173504
    m_Localized: READ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763237367808
    m_Localized: SHARE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763237367809
    m_Localized: SKIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721479
    m_Localized: Hello! This message would be a reaction to the article you just
      sent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721480
    m_Localized: I am an acquaintance of yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721481
    m_Localized: In fact, I do not exist and I have nothing to do with anyone you
      know in real life with my name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721482
    m_Localized: Good morning! I am another of your acquaintances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721483
    m_Localized: In this chat we'll be telling you what your articles makes us feel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721484
    m_Localized: For now, we'll be going back to the page you were on before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721485
    m_Localized: To do that, I need you to press the "OK" button at the bottom of
      the screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721486
    m_Localized: Try it! (It has appeared now)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618628841472
    m_Localized: SOURCE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978816
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978817
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978818
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416448
    m_Localized: FAMILY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416449
    m_Localized: FRIENDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416450
    m_Localized: NEIGHBOURS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 427584111697920
    m_Localized: Have you seen this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335212883968
    m_Localized: I had already seen it, but thank you anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992832
    m_Localized: Michael had already sent it to me. I think we're going to ask for
      something, let's see if it works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992833
    m_Localized: Please don't share this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992834
    m_Localized: This is a scam, please don't fall for it. They just want your information.
      The government doesn't offer grants like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992835
    m_Localized: Thank you for sharing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992836
    m_Localized: Thank you! The food in the bar's freezer went bad, so this money
      will come in handy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960068800512
    m_Localized: You have shared a fake new.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103680
    m_Localized: Haven't you noticed how it was written?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103681
    m_Localized: You should read the news you are sharing. Sharing fake news may
      cause grave consequences
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103682
    m_Localized: You have shared a true news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103683
    m_Localized: You were lucky enough that it was true, because you didn't read
      it. You should reed the news you share.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815863758848
    m_Localized: Welcome to Level UP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815909896192
    m_Localized: Choose your language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815909896193
    m_Localized: This is Level UP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090496
    m_Localized: In the game, you will interact with different news stories. You
      can interact with them by forwarding them to acquaintances (or not!) and see
      how they react to what you send them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090497
    m_Localized: Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090498
    m_Localized: Has the blackout affected you? Here is how you can receive a compensation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090499
    m_Localized: New notification
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090500
    m_Localized: Open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805145240690688
    m_Localized: Your Influence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438567223296
    m_Localized: That's all, you have reached the end of the game!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438634332160
    m_Localized: Let's take a moment to review what we have learnt!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438634332161
    m_Localized: What have we learnt?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438634332162
    m_Localized: News are at everyone's fingertips with new technologies. It is important
      to learn how to understand it and not fall prey to misinformation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526464
    m_Localized: What have we learnt?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526465
    m_Localized: That's why we should avoid settling for just a title, no matter
      how appealing it may be...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526466
    m_Localized: Being informed is key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526467
    m_Localized: We have to READ the news before sharing them with anyone, because
      we don't know the damage we might be causing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526468
    m_Localized: See the source
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526469
    m_Localized: It is important that we see WHO writes the article to know whether
      we can place more trust in the content or not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526470
    m_Localized: How is it written
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526471
    m_Localized: It is also very important to pay attention to how the information
      is written. Fake articles often incite hatred or do not cite truly reliable
      sources.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2919120602107904
    m_Localized: We hope you enjoyed it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2919120602107905
    m_Localized: Press the button to go back to the main menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8072467420995584
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9056519614861312
    m_Localized: Understood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9056519644221440
    m_Localized: VERIFY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14472164729610240
    m_Localized: Read Articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14472164788330496
    m_Localized: True Articles Shared
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14472164788330497
    m_Localized: False Articles Shared
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758147280896
    m_Localized: Welcome to U.A.M.F
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778368
    m_Localized: "Thank you for participating in our training program for the U.A.M.F
      brigade (United Anti\u2011Misinformation Force)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778369
    m_Localized: Welcome to U.A.M.F
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778370
    m_Localized: Our goal is to prepare selected groups to fight misinformation.
      Your years and experience make you the ideal person for this mission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778371
    m_Localized: Welcome to U.A.M.F
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778372
    m_Localized: Grandparents are a source of knowledge and are always ready to help
      their loved ones in difficult moments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778373
    m_Localized: U.A.M.F needs you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778374
    m_Localized: We are in a moment of crisis and we need your help. We live in times
      of division and disagreement, and one of the main factors is misinformation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778375
    m_Localized: U.A.M.F needs you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778376
    m_Localized: Misinformation spreads like wildfire thanks to new technologies,
      such as smartphones with internet access.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778377
    m_Localized: U.A.M.F trains you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758226972672
    m_Localized: "Your wisdom can help the world. U.A.M.F prepares our members to
      keep the population well\u2011informed with verified and up\u2011to\u2011date
      articles."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758226972673
    m_Localized: U.A.M.F needs you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758226972674
    m_Localized: Your mission is to process the articles you receive and evaluate
      whether they contain truthful information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758226972675
    m_Localized: Let's begin!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758226972676
    m_Localized: Forward, recruit! Training begins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14487224642363392
    m_Localized: Web Page
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14487224688500736
    m_Localized: Social Media
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14487224688500737
    m_Localized: Newspapers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14487224688500738
    m_Localized: Internet Blog
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832853528576
    m_Localized: You should try again...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832853528577
    m_Localized: Keep going!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832853528578
    m_Localized: Good job! You've done right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832857722880
    m_Localized: Congratulations! You have completed the training
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832857722881
    m_Localized: You have read {0}/{1} articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832857722882
    m_Localized: You have shared {0} false articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832857722883
    m_Localized: You have shared {0} true articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645209194496
    m_Localized: It seems manipulative
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137536
    m_Localized: It's interesting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137537
    m_Localized: I don't know
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137538
    m_Localized: Yes, I understood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137539
    m_Localized: No, repeat it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137540
    m_Localized: It's true
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137541
    m_Localized: It's false
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137542
    m_Localized: FRIENDS Group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137543
    m_Localized: FAMILY Group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137544
    m_Localized: NEIGHBOURS Group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137545
    m_Localized: Next step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736433614848
    m_Localized: The White House mocks a deported immigrant by turning him into a
      parody on social media.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140800
    m_Localized: "On Monday night, the White House posted an image created by artificial
      intelligence on its social media accounts, both on Instagram and X. The image
      shows a box resembling those used for Labubu dolls, and inside, a drawing of
      a man in handcuffs alongside the phrase: \u201CIllegal foreign sex predator
      arrested by ICE. Deported!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15587561838448640
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15587561892974592
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15587561892974593
    m_Localized: Do you want to play the tutorial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19949382909267968
    m_Localized: Level Complete!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19949383009931264
    m_Localized: Press 'OK' to go to the Quiz section
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19989448662683648
    m_Localized: You should read more articles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19989448721403904
    m_Localized: You have skipped a true article. Pay more attention!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19989448721403905
    m_Localized: Be careful with what you share! You have spread misinformation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20016544571166720
    m_Localized: NEXT LEVEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
